# AgentVerdict OS frontend — example environment file.
# Public configuration only. No secret ever belongs in a Vite env var: every
# VITE_* variable is bundled into the static build and is visible to anyone
# who opens the site.

# Optional build-time default for the deployed AgentVerdictOS contract
# address. Leave unset until a human with a StudioNet signing key has
# actually deployed contracts/agentverdict.py (see docs/DEPLOYMENT_RUNBOOK.md
# and deployments/studionet.json, which currently records NOT_DEPLOYED).
# The Settings screen can also set/override this at runtime via
# localStorage, without a rebuild.
# VITE_CONTRACT_ADDRESS=0x_the_real_deployed_address
